/// Chapter 4 of the guide, written from md-docs/coming-from/react-vue-svelte.md by
/// scripts/docsite/guide.py; edit the guide, not this file.
page ComingFromGuide(path: "/docs/guide/coming-from", title: "Coming from React, Vue or Svelte", description: "A map from React, Vue, Svelte and HTMX concepts to WebFluent: state, effects, components, props, slots, context, routing, fetching and styling.", layout: DocsShell("Coming from React, Vue or Svelte", kind: .comingfrom, chapter: t("nav.group.start"), blurb: "What you already know, mapped to what is here — and the few places WebFluent works differently.", source: "md-docs/coming-from/react-vue-svelte.md", sections: [Anchor(id: "the-map", label: "The map"), Anchor(id: "one-component-side-by-side", label: "One component, side by side"), Anchor(id: "what-works-differently", label: "What works differently"), Anchor(id: "things-you-might-look-for", label: "Things you might look for")], prevTo: "/docs/guide/tutorial", prevLabel: t("ch.03"), nextTo: "/docs/tutorials/todos", nextLabel: t("ch.05"))) {
    Stack(gap: .lg) {
        Markdown("If you have built with a JavaScript framework, most of WebFluent will feel familiar: components with props, reactive state, a router, a store. This chapter maps those ideas across, then explains the places where WebFluent works differently.\n\nThe one thing to remember: WebFluent is a compiler with typed markup, not a library, so a component's body runs once and only the parts that read a changed value update.\n\nIn this chapter:\n\n- [The map](#the-map) from framework concepts to WebFluent\n- [One component, side by side](#one-component-side-by-side) in React, Vue, Svelte and WebFluent\n- [What works differently](#what-works-differently)\n- [Things you might look for](#things-you-might-look-for), such as npm packages and server rendering")

        Heading("The map", id: "the-map").h2

        Markdown("Find the idea you know in the first column:")

        Table(caption: "The map") {
            Table.Head {
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell("You know").header
                    Table.Cell("In WebFluent").header
                    Table.Cell("Chapter").header
                }
            }
            Table.Body {
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`useState`, `ref()`, `let x` (Svelte)") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`state count = 0`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[State](/docs/guide/state)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`useMemo`, `computed()`, `$:` / `$derived`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`derived total = …`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[State](/docs/guide/state#derived)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`useEffect`, `watchEffect`, `$effect`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`effect \{ … cleanup \{ … \} \}`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[State](/docs/guide/state#effect)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`useRef` on an element") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`Input(ref: box)`, then `box.focus()`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[State](/docs/guide/state#element-handles)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell("a component function / SFC")
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`component Name(props) \{ … \}`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[Components](/docs/guide/components)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell("props")
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("typed props: `component Card(_ title: String, tone: Tone = .calm)`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[Components](/docs/guide/components)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`children`, default slot") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`slot` + `children`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[Components](/docs/guide/components#slots)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell("named slots, render props")
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`slot trailing`, scoped slots `slot row(item: T)`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[Components](/docs/guide/components#slots)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("callback props, `$emit`, `createEventDispatcher`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`event change(value: Number)` + `emit change(n)`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[Components](/docs/guide/components#events)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`v-model`, `bind:value`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`Input(bind: name)`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[Forms](/docs/guide/forms)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell("context, provide/inject, a global store")
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("`store Cart \{ … \}`, read as `Cart.items`") }
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("[Stores](/docs/guide/stores)") }
                }
                Table.Row {
                    Table.Cell("Redux / Pinia / Zustand")
                    Table.Cell { Markdown("a `store` with `action`s; `wf serve` shows every action") }
